- Put the destination of a forwarded invoice in its route hints
  `POST /api/v1/lightning/receives/invoice/for-address` takes
  `ark_address_hint`. When it is true, the invoice carries the Ark address, and
  a wallet on the same Ark server can pay it with an arkoor straight to that
  address.
- Report wallet lookup failures when fetching a Lightning receive
  `GET /api/v1/lightning/receives/{identifier}` returns 500 if the wallet
  cannot read the receive. A completed lookup for an unknown receipt returns
  the existing 404 response.
